the number of 1’s in the binary expansion of the initial total.  Player A can
ensure this by always erasing a pair of equal numbers; player B cannot force a
smaller final number.

The binary representation of \(1997\) is  

\[
1997_{10}=11111001101_{2},
\]

which contains \(8\) ones.

