&(14,15)-(15,15),\;(15,1)-(15,2),\;(15,5)-(15,6).
\end{aligned}
\]

Every listed pair consists of two squares whose Chebyshev distance is at most 2,
and a direct check shows that each square has **exactly one** neighbour inside
